## Temp Files

When generating PR bodies, commit messages, or other disposable files, write them to `.cursor/tmp/`
(gitignored). Clean up after use.

```bash
# PR body
.cursor/tmp/pr-body.md

# Commit message
.cursor/tmp/commit-msg.txt
```

**Never** write temp files to the repo root.
